{%- comment -%}
  GARELON · Packs sobre VARIANTES REALES de Shopify.

  Caso base (Pulsera Rosario): una sola opción
    Pack: 1 pulsera / 2 pulseras / 3 pulseras
  = 3 variantes reales, cada una con su precio en Shopify. Si el producto tuviera además otra
  opción real con varios valores, se muestra como botones (garelon-choice) y cada pack se
  combina con ese valor; las opciones de UN solo valor (p. ej. «Title: Único» importado del
  proveedor) van ocultas y marcadas.

  Cada pack es UNA variante y la cantidad es siempre 1: «2 pulseras» llega al carrito (y al
  proveedor) como esa variante × 1, nunca «1 pulsera» × 2. Este bloque sustituye al selector
  de variantes Y al de cantidad (las secciones no pintan «Selector de cantidad» si existe
  este bloque) y añade quantity=1 al formulario.

  Qué ve el cliente ANTES de añadir al carrito: «Elige tu pack» y una tarjeta por pack con su
  etiqueta editorial (p. ej. «Individual», «Pack de 2») y el precio real de la variante.
  Solo si los precios reales lo justifican (calculado, nada escrito a mano):
    - «Ahorra X €»: precio de la variante de 1 × unidades − precio del pack (si es > 0).
    - precio por unidad: precio del pack ÷ unidades (ajuste: siempre o solo con ahorro real).
    - insignia «Mejor precio/unidad»: solo en el pack con el precio por unidad más bajo, si es
      el único con ese precio y tiene más de 1 unidad.
  No se usa compare_at_price.

  Cómo funciona:
  - Pinta el <variant-selects> de Dawn con radios compatibles (form, data-option-value-id,
    data-product-url, data-option-name). Dawn hace el resto sin JS propio: product-info.js
    pide la sección a Shopify con los valores elegidos, actualiza precio, stock, botón, id
    de la variante y URL (?variant=) y vuelve a pintar el bloque con los datos reales.
  - Opción de packs: la indicada en «Nombre de la opción», la única opción con varios
    valores, una opción llamada «Pack»/«Packs»/«Cantidad», o la única cuyos valores llevan
    todos un número.
  - Unidades: el primer número del valor («2 pulseras», «Pack 2», «2PCS», «x2» → 2) o el
    ajuste «Unidades de cada pack» (1,2,3). Debe existir el pack de 1 (referencia del ahorro).
  - Selección inicial: la de Shopify (?variant= o la primera variante disponible).
  - Pack agotado o inexistente: tarjeta desactivada con «Agotado» / «No disponible», sin
    cifras de stock.
  - Si el producto no cumple las condiciones (p. ej. aún tiene una sola variante): selector
    estándar de Dawn y, SOLO en el editor de temas, un aviso con el motivo exacto. El cliente
    nunca ve el aviso y la tienda sigue vendiendo la variante única.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object}
  - block: {Object} bloque garelon_packs
  - product_form_id: {String}
  - product_unassigned: {Boolean} (opcional) la sección no tiene producto elegido y usa el primero del catálogo

  Usage:
  {% render 'garelon-packs', product: product, block: block, product_form_id: product_form_id %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign pack_option = null
  assign pack_issue = ''
  assign pack_issue_value = ''
  assign wanted_option = block.settings.option_name | strip | downcase

  if product.has_only_default_variant
    assign pack_issue = 'single_variant'
  else
    assign variable_count = 0
    assign named_option = null
    assign numeric_option = null
    assign numeric_count = 0
    for option in product.options_with_values
      assign current_option = option.name | strip | downcase
      if wanted_option != blank and current_option == wanted_option
        assign pack_option = option
      endif
      if option.values.size > 1
        assign variable_count = variable_count | plus: 1
        assign last_variable = option
        if current_option == 'pack' or current_option == 'packs' or current_option == 'cantidad'
          assign named_option = option
        endif
        assign all_numeric = true
        for value in option.values
          assign digits_removed = value.name | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9'
          if digits_removed == value.name
            assign all_numeric = false
            break
          endif
        endfor
        if all_numeric
          assign numeric_option = option
          assign numeric_count = numeric_count | plus: 1
        endif
      endif
    endfor

    if wanted_option != blank
      if pack_option == null
        assign pack_issue = 'option_name'
      endif
    elsif variable_count == 1
      assign pack_option = last_variable
    elsif named_option != null
      assign pack_option = named_option
    elsif numeric_count == 1
      assign pack_option = numeric_option
    else
      assign pack_issue = 'multi_option'
    endif
    if pack_issue != ''
      assign pack_option = null
    endif
  endif

  assign manual_units = block.settings.pack_units | remove: ' ' | split: ','
  if pack_option != null and manual_units.size > 0 and manual_units.size != pack_option.values.size
    assign pack_issue = 'pack_units'
    assign pack_option = null
  endif

  # Primera pasada: unidades de cada valor y la variante de ese pack con el resto de opciones elegidas.
  # Se guardan en listas (mismo orden que los valores) para las pasadas siguientes.
  assign units_list = ''
  assign variant_ids = ''
  assign seen_units = ','
  assign has_single = false
  assign first_units = 0
  if pack_option != null
    for value in pack_option.values
      assign units = 0
      if manual_units.size > 0
        assign units_token = manual_units[forloop.index0]
        assign units = units_token | plus: 0
        assign units_string = units | append: ''
        if units_string != units_token
          assign units = 0
        endif
      else
        assign clean_name = value.name | downcase | replace: '×', ' ' | replace: 'x', ' ' | replace: 'pcs', ' ' | replace: 'pc', ' ' | replace: 'uds', ' ' | replace: 'ud', ' ' | replace: '(', ' ' | replace: ')', ' ' | replace: ':', ' ' | replace: '-', ' ' | replace: ',', ' '
        assign name_words = clean_name | split: ' '
        for word in name_words
          assign word_number = word | plus: 0
          assign word_string = word_number | append: ''
          if word_number > 0 and word_string == word
            assign units = word_number
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif

      assign units_string = units | append: ''
      assign units_key = ',' | append: units_string | append: ','
      if units < 1
        assign pack_issue = 'units'
        assign pack_issue_value = value.name
        break
      endif
      if seen_units contains units_key
        assign pack_issue = 'duplicate'
        assign pack_issue_value = value.name
        break
      endif
      assign seen_units = seen_units | append: units_string | append: ','
      assign units_list = units_list | append: units_string | append: ','
      if forloop.first
        assign first_units = units
      endif
      if units == 1
        assign has_single = true
      endif

      # Variante de este pack con el resto de opciones tal como están elegidas.
      assign pack_variant = value.variant
      if pack_variant == blank
        for candidate in product.variants
          assign candidate_match = true
          for option in product.options_with_values
            assign option_index = option.position | minus: 1
            if option.name == pack_option.name
              if candidate.options[option_index] != value.name
                assign candidate_match = false
              endif
            elsif candidate.options[option_index] != option.selected_value
              assign candidate_match = false
            endif
          endfor
          if candidate_match
            assign pack_variant = candidate
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
      if pack_variant == blank
        assign variant_ids = variant_ids | append: '0,'
      else
        assign variant_ids = variant_ids | append: pack_variant.id | append: ','
      endif
    endfor
    if pack_issue == '' and has_single == false
      assign pack_issue = 'no_single'
    endif
  endif

  assign pack_mode = false
  if pack_option != null and pack_issue == ''
    assign pack_mode = true
  endif

  # Segunda pasada: precio del pack de 1, mejor precio por unidad y ahorro.
  assign base_price = null
  assign best_unit_price = 999999999
  assign best_count = 0
  assign best_units = 0
  assign any_savings = false
  if pack_mode
    assign units_array = units_list | split: ','
    assign ids_array = variant_ids | split: ','
    for id_token in ids_array
      assign units = units_array[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
      assign target_id = id_token | plus: 0
      if units == 1 and target_id > 0
        for candidate in product.variants
          if candidate.id == target_id
            assign base_price = candidate.price
            break
          endif
        endfor
      endif
    endfor
    for id_token in ids_array
      assign units = units_array[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
      assign target_id = id_token | plus: 0
      if target_id == 0
        continue
      endif
      for candidate in product.variants
        if candidate.id == target_id
          assign unit_price = candidate.price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: units | round
          if unit_price < best_unit_price
            assign best_unit_price = unit_price
            assign best_count = 1
            assign best_units = units
          elsif unit_price == best_unit_price
            assign best_count = best_count | plus: 1
          endif
          if base_price != null and units > 1 and candidate.available
            assign reference_price = base_price | times: units
            if reference_price > candidate.price
              assign any_savings = true
            endif
          endif
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endfor
  endif

  assign show_badge = false
  if pack_mode and block.settings.badge_text != blank and best_count == 1 and best_units > 1
    assign show_badge = true
  endif

  # Avisos que no bloquean (solo en el editor de temas).
  assign pack_notice = ''
  if pack_mode and first_units != 1
    assign pack_notice = 'order'
  endif
  assign combinations = 1
  if pack_mode
    for option in product.options_with_values
      assign combinations = combinations | times: option.values.size
    endfor
  endif
-%}

{%- if request.design_mode -%}
  {%- render 'garelon-packs-diagnostic',
    product: product,
    block: block,
    pack_issue: pack_issue,
    pack_issue_value: pack_issue_value,
    pack_notice: pack_notice,
    pack_mode: pack_mode,
    combinations: combinations,
    product_unassigned: product_unassigned
  -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if pack_mode -%}
  <variant-selects
    id="variant-selects-{{ section.id }}"
    class="g-packs"
    data-section="{{ section.id }}"
    data-product-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
    data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-currency-code="{{ cart.currency.iso_code }}"
    {% # theme-check-disable %}
    data-selected-price-amount="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | default: 0 | money_amount | escape }}"
    {% # theme-check-enable %}
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- comment -%} 1) Opciones que no son el pack: botones (varios valores) u opciones fijas (ocultas). {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- render 'garelon-choice',
      product: product,
      block: block,
      pack_option_name: pack_option.name,
      product_form_id: product_form_id
    -%}

    {%- comment -%} 2) Packs. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if any_savings and block.settings.offer_label != blank -%}
      <p class="g-packs__offer">{{ block.settings.offer_label | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <fieldset class="product-form__input g-packs__fieldset">
      <legend class="g-packs__legend">
        {{- block.settings.heading | default: pack_option.name | escape -}}
      </legend>
      {%- if block.settings.intro != blank -%}
        <p class="g-packs__intro">{{ block.settings.intro | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="g-packs__list">
        {%- for value in pack_option.values -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign units = units_array[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
            assign target_id = ids_array[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
            assign pack_variant = null
            if target_id > 0
              for candidate in product.variants
                if candidate.id == target_id
                  assign pack_variant = candidate
                  break
                endif
              endfor
            endif
            assign pack_available = false
            if pack_variant and pack_variant.available
              assign pack_available = true
            endif

            if units == 1
              assign unit_word = block.settings.unit_singular
            else
              assign unit_word = block.settings.unit_plural
            endif
            if unit_word != blank
              assign pack_label = units | append: ' ' | append: unit_word
            else
              assign pack_label = value.name
            endif

            assign pack_tag = blank
            case units
              when 1
                assign pack_tag = block.settings.tag_1
              when 2
                assign pack_tag = block.settings.tag_2
              when 3
                assign pack_tag = block.settings.tag_3
            endcase

            assign savings = 0
            assign card_savings = false
            if pack_variant
              assign unit_price = pack_variant.price | times: 1.0 | divided_by: units | round
              if base_price != null and units > 1
                assign reference_price = base_price | times: units
                assign savings = reference_price | minus: pack_variant.price
                if savings > 0
                  assign savings_percent = savings | times: 100.0 | divided_by: reference_price | round
                endif
              endif
              if block.settings.show_savings and savings > 0 and pack_available
                assign card_savings = true
              endif
            endif

            assign card_badge = false
            if show_badge and units == best_units and pack_available
              assign card_badge = true
            endif

            assign unit_name = block.settings.unit_singular | default: 'unidad'
            assign input_id = section.id | append: '-' | append: pack_option.position | append: '-' | append: forloop.index0
          -%}
          <div class="g-packs__item">
            <input
              type="radio"
              class="g-packs__input"
              id="{{ input_id }}"
              name="{{ pack_option.name | escape }}-{{ pack_option.position }}"
              value="{{ value | escape }}"
              form="{{ product_form_id }}"
              data-product-url="{{ value.product_url }}"
              data-option-value-id="{{ value.id }}"
              data-option-name="{{ pack_option.name | escape }}"
              data-pack-units="{{ units }}"
              data-pack-label="{{ pack_label | escape }}"
              data-choice-label="{{ pack_label | escape }}"
              {% if value.selected %}
                checked
              {% endif %}
              {% unless pack_available %}
                disabled
              {% endunless %}
            >
            <label
              class="g-pack{% if card_badge %} g-pack--badge{% endif %}{% unless pack_available %} g-pack--soldout{% endunless %}"
              for="{{ input_id }}"
            >
              {%- if card_badge -%}
                <span class="g-pack__badge">{{ block.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="g-pack__radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="g-pack__body">
                <span class="g-pack__head">
                  <span class="g-pack__title">
                    <span class="g-pack__name">{{ pack_label | escape }}</span>
                    {%- if pack_tag != blank -%}
                      <span class="g-pack__tag">{{ pack_tag | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  {%- if pack_variant -%}
                    <span class="g-pack__price">{{ pack_variant.price | money }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </span>
                {%- liquid
                  assign card_unit_price = false
                  if block.settings.show_unit_price and pack_variant
                    if block.settings.unit_price_only_savings == false or any_savings
                      assign card_unit_price = true
                    endif
                  endif
                -%}
                {%- if card_unit_price -%}
                  <span class="g-pack__unit">
                    {{- unit_price | money -}}
                    <span aria-hidden="true">/{{ unit_name | escape }}</span>
                    <span class="visually-hidden"> por {{ unit_name | escape }}</span>
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if card_savings -%}
                  <span class="g-pack__save">
                    Ahorra {{ savings | money -}}
                    {%- if block.settings.show_percent -%}
                      {{ ' ' }}<span class="g-pack__percent">(-{{ savings_percent }}&nbsp;%)</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </span>
                  {%- if block.settings.show_reference and block.settings.reference_label != blank -%}
                    <span class="g-pack__ref">
                      {{- block.settings.reference_label | escape }}
                      {{ reference_price | money -}}
                    </span>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <span class="visually-hidden">
                      frente a comprar {{ pack_label | escape }} por separado ({{ reference_price | money }})</span
                    >
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- elsif units == 1 and any_savings and pack_available and block.settings.single_note != blank -%}
                  <span class="g-pack__plain">{{ block.settings.single_note | escape }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if pack_variant == null -%}
                  <span class="g-pack__status">No disponible</span>
                {%- elsif pack_available == false -%}
                  <span class="g-pack__status">{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </fieldset>
    {%- if any_savings and block.settings.savings_note != blank -%}
      <p class="g-packs__note">{{ block.settings.savings_note | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <script type="application/json" data-selected-variant>
      {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant | json }}
    </script>
  </variant-selects>
{%- else -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <!-- GARELON packs: selector estándar (motivo: {{ pack_issue }}) -->
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- render 'product-variant-picker', product: product, block: block, product_form_id: product_form_id -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Cantidad fija 1: el pack ya incluye sus unidades. Las secciones no pintan el «Selector de
  cantidad» cuando existe este bloque, así que este es el único campo quantity del formulario.
{%- endcomment -%}
<input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1" form="{{ product_form_id }}">
